# Noise — Intern Fullstack & AI Innovation — Role Research

## Company
Noise (Go Noise): Indian consumer tech brand best known for smartwatches, earbuds, and TWS audio.  
Gurgaon HQ. ~2,000+ employees. Hardware + software ecosystem; building AI features into wearables.

## Why Soham fits exceptionally well
- Noise makes **wearable hardware with embedded software** — Soham built Aura, a self-funded wearable AI pendant (ESP32-S3, hardware enclosure, edge integration). This is the exact intersection.
- Noise is expanding into AI features — Soham has built AI agents, voice AI, multi-LLM systems.
- Android SDK matters for companion apps — Soham built John (Kotlin/Jetpack Compose + Python LiveKit agent).
- Full-stack (React + FastAPI) — LLM-Council covers this.

## Key gaps to be honest about
- No Flutter/Swift experience
- Docker/CI/CD not prominent in profile
- Not familiar with Noise's internal stack

